build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Models — large binaries we don't track
models/*.gguf
models/*.bin

# Voices — same reason
voices/*.gguf
voices/*.bin

# Vendored dependency checkouts — each is its own git repo, cloned by hand.
# NOT submodules (unlike vendor/localvqe, which is tracked in .gitmodules).
# Together they are ~2 GB, so keep them out of `git add -A`.
#   vendor/CrispASR   — fork of https://github.com/CrispStrobe/CrispASR,
#       branch `gemma-live`. Upstream ALONE IS NOT ENOUGH: the streaming
#       VibeVoice API (vibevoice_tts_stream_*) and the crispasr-tts target
#       this project links are on that branch and nowhere else. It currently
#       has no reachable remote — the work is committed locally only, so
#       treat this checkout as the sole copy until one exists.
#   vendor/llama.cpp  — https://github.com/tbtlr/llama.cpp @ gemma-live
vendor/CrispASR/
vendor/llama.cpp/
